# Text is checked out with LF line endings on every system, whatever the
# machine's git settings, so tests, scripts and builds read the same bytes
# on Windows as on macOS and Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Kept byte for byte as committed: cmd.exe reads batch files with CRLF, and
# these fixtures are compared exactly.
*.cmd -text
*.bat -text
docs/testing/**/*.csv -text
